<?xml version="1.0" encoding="UTF-8"?>
<!DOCTYPE plist PUBLIC "-//Apple//DTD PLIST 1.0//EN" "http://www.apple.com/DTDs/PropertyList-1.0.dtd">
<!--
SPDX-FileCopyrightText: 2026 Open Health Technology Foundation contributors
SPDX-License-Identifier: AGPL-3.0-or-later WITH LicenseRef-PanicButton-app-store-exception

Merged by Tauri into the macOS app's Info.plist (spec/05-desktop-agent.md,
Platform notes): the text macOS shows when it asks for Local Network access,
and the Bonjour service the app browses, without which macOS refuses mDNS
discovery.
-->
<plist version="1.0">
<dict>
  <key>NSLocalNetworkUsageDescription</key>
  <string>Panic Button uses the local network to send and receive alarms from other computers in your practice.</string>
  <key>NSBonjourServices</key>
  <array>
    <string>_panic-button._udp</string>
  </array>
</dict>
</plist>
